<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Pari Traders | Quality Goods, Fair Prices</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Pari Traders supplies textiles, home essentials and packaged goods in High, Medium and Low quality tiers at honest wholesale prices.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">
        <span class="brand-mark">PT</span>
        <span class="brand-text">
          Pari Traders
          <small>Since 1998</small>
        </span>
      </a>

      <button class="nav-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>

      <nav class="site-nav" id="site-nav">
        <a href="index.html" class="active" aria-current="page">Home</a>
        <a href="products.html">Products</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="nav-cta">Enquire Now</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Wholesale &amp; Retail Suppliers</span>
          <h1>Goods you can trust, prices you can <em>plan around</em>.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            For over two decades Pari Traders has supplied families, shops and offices with
            textiles, home essentials and packaged goods — in the quality tier that fits your budget.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">Place an Enquiry</a>
            <a href="products.html" class="btn btn-outline">Browse Products</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-visual" aria-label="Our quality tiers">
          <h3>Choose your quality</h3>

          <div class="tier-row">
            <span>High Quality</span>
            <span class="tier-dots" aria-hidden="true">
              <i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i>
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-row">
            <span>Medium Quality</span>
            <span class="tier-dots" aria-hidden="true">
              <i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i></i>
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-row">
            <span>Low Quality</span>
            <span class="tier-dots" aria-hidden="true">
              <i class="on"></i><i></i><i></i>
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-row">
            <span>Same price list</span>
            <span class="tier-note">for every tier</span>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="stat">
          <strong>27+</strong>
          <span>Years trading</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <strong>1,200+</strong>
          <span>Regular customers</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <strong>40+</strong>
          <span>Product lines</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <strong>3</strong>
          <span>Quality tiers</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Quality tiers</span>
            <h2>One shop, three standards</h2>
            <p class="lead">Every product line is stocked in three grades, so you never pay for more than you need.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <article class="card tier-card highlight">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M12 3l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.2 1 5.9-5.2-2.8-5.2 2.8 1-5.9L3.5 9.2l5.9-.9L12 3z"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tag tag-gold">Premium</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tier-label">High Quality</span>
            <span class="tier-sub">Best finish</span>
            <p>Long-lasting materials, tighter stitching and stricter checks. The default choice for gifting and resale.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card tier-card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h10"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tag">Balanced</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tier-label">Medium Quality</span>
            <span class="tier-sub">Best value</span>
            <p>Everyday goods with solid build quality at a lower price point. Our most ordered tier for households and shops.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card tier-card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M12 3v18M5 10l7-7 7 7"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tag">Budget</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tier-label">Low Quality</span>
            <span class="tier-sub">Lowest price</span>
            <p>Practical stock for bulk buyers where volume matters more than finish. Quoted openly, never swapped silently.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container split">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Why us</span>
          <h2>A trader that answers the phone</h2>
          <p class="lead">No hidden substitutions, no surprise invoices. You order a quality tier and receive exactly that tier.</p>

          <div class="feature-list" style="margin-top: 26px;">
            <div class="feature">
              <span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Honest grading</h3>
                <p>Each lot is sorted before dispatch, so the tier you pick is the tier that arrives.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
              <span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Same-week dispatch</h3>
                <p>Local deliveries within the city and courier dispatch across the state within 48 hours.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
              <span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Wholesale rates for all</h3>
                <p>Retail customers and shopkeepers are quoted from the same open price list.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <blockquote class="quote">
            “We have bought fabrics from Pari Traders for eleven years. The medium grade is exactly what my tailoring
            customers expect, and the bills are always clear.”
            <cite>— Regular customer, textile shop</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Popular lines</span>
            <h2>What we stock</h2>
          </div>
          <a href="products.html" class="btn btn-ghost">View all products</a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <article class="card product-card" data-tier="high">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M3 7l9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4z"/><path d="M3 12l9 4 9-4M3 17l9 4 9-4"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tag">Textiles</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Cotton &amp; Linen Fabrics</h3>
            <p>Dress material, bedsheets, towels and shirting in three graded qualities.</p>
            <p class="price">From ₹240 <small>/ metre</small></p>
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-ghost">Ask for rates</a>
          </article>

          <article class="card product-card" data-tier="medium">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M4 10h16v10H4z"/><path d="M8 10V6a4 4 0 018 0v4"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tag">Home</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Home &amp; Kitchen Essentials</h3>
            <p>Steel utensils, storage jars, spice boxes and cleaning supplies in bulk packs.</p>
            <p class="price">From ₹95 <small>/ piece</small></p>
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-ghost">Ask for rates</a>
          </article>

          <article class="card product-card" data-tier="low">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M3 8h13v8H3z"/><path d="M16 11h3l2 3v2h-5z"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="tag">Packaged</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Packaged Staples</h3>
            <p>Rice, pulses, sugar and tea sourced in season and packed to order.</p>
            <p class="price">From ₹58 <small>/ kg</small></p>
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-ghost">Ask for rates</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-band">
          <div>
            <h2>Share your requirement, get a quote</h2>
            <p>Tell us the product, the quality tier and the quantity — we reply with rates the same day.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">Fill the enquiry form</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div>
          <h4>Pari Traders</h4>
          <p>Family-run wholesale and retail traders since 1998. Textiles, home essentials and packaged goods in three honest quality tiers.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4>Pages</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="products.html">Products</a></li>
            <li><a href="about.html">About us</a></li>
            <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4>Popular</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="products.html">Textiles</a></li>
            <li><a href="products.html">Home &amp; kitchen</a></li>
            <li><a href="products.html">Packaged staples</a></li>
            <li><a href="products.html">Hardware &amp; tools</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4>Visit the shop</h4>
          <p>Shop No. 14, Main Bazaar Road,<br>Near Old Bus Stand</p>
          <p>Mon – Sat, 9:30 am – 8:00 pm</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <div class="container">
        <span>&copy; <span data-year>2026</span> Pari Traders. All rights reserved.</span>
        <span>Made with care for our customers.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
